        "carrier_operation": "EM catapult launch + arrested landing aboard Fujian; also STOBAR-capable (csg-cn-fujian-dod-cmpr2025, A; csg-cn-j15t-usni-2026, B)",
        "catobar_features": "Reinforced twin-wheel nose gear with launch bar, tailhook, wing and stabilator fold, tail MAWS sensor (observed on Zhuhai 2024 display airframe 1518) (csg-cn-j15t-usni-2026, B)",
