        "mass": "Empty weight 17,500-17,700kg; MTOW 32,500-33,000kg, reachable only from catapult (csg-cn-j15-wiki, C)",
        "internal_fuel": "~9,400-9,800kg (csg-cn-j15-wiki, C)",
        "engines": "2x WS-10-series, at least some airframes; some may still fly AL-31F (csg-cn-j15t-usni-2026, B; forum reports, C)",
        "speed": "Mach 2.17-2.4, not demonstrated with stores (csg-cn-j15-wiki, C)",
        "combat_radius": "~1,270km baseline internal fuel (C); CATOBAR radius not public; engineering_estimate 1,000-1,300km trading fuel vs weapons under catapult launch",
