        "service_ceiling": "18,000m (Chinese sources give 20,000m) (csg-cn-j15-wiki, C)",
        "radar": "New AESA behind canted, pitot-less radome, designation not public; TWZ/Aviationist say 'probably same as J-11D' (csg-cn-j15t-twz, csg-cn-j15t-aviationist, B). Baseline J-15 used Type 1493 pulse-Doppler (C)",
